-         * wProcessorArchitecture is PROCESSOR_ARCHITECTURE_INTEL,
-         * wProcessorLevel is defined by the CPU vendor. If
-         * wProcessorArchitecture is PROCESSOR_ARCHITECTURE_IA64,
-         * wProcessorLevel is set to 1.
-         */
